  },
  "duration": 96.765,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all these things",
      "verse": "9:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 1.759,
      "end": 4.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did my father see, and hear, and speak,",
      "verse": "9:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 4.586,
      "end": 8.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as he dwelt in a tent, in the valley of Lemuel,",
      "verse": "9:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.203,
      "end": 10.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also a great many more things,",
      "verse": "9:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 10.659,
      "end": 13.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which cannot be written upon these plates.",
      "verse": "9:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 13.707,
      "end": 16.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, as I have spoken concerning these plates,",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 17.045,
      "end": 19.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold they are not the plates",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 19.872,
      "end": 23.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon which I make a full account of the history of my people;",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 23.999,
      "end": 27.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the plates upon which I make a full account of my people",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 27.801,
      "end": 29.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have given the name of Nephi;",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 30.024,
      "end": 33.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they are called the plates of Nephi, after mine own name;",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 33.873,
      "end": 36.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and these plates also are called the plates of Nephi.",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 37.479,
      "end": 40.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, I have received a commandment of the Lord",
      "verse": "9:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 41.003,
      "end": 42.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should make these plates,",
      "verse": "9:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 43.087,
      "end": 44.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the special purpose",
      "verse": "9:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 44.707,
      "end": 49.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there should be a account engraven of the ministry of my people.",
      "verse": "9:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 50.403,
      "end": 52.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Upon the other plates should be engraven",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 53.044,
      "end": 55.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "an account of the reign of the kings,",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 55.453,
      "end": 58.472,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the wars and contentions of my people;",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 58.652,
      "end": 62.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore these plates are for the more part of the ministry;",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 62.222,
      "end": 67.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the other plates are for the more part of the reign of the kings",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 67.557,
      "end": 70.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the wars and contentions of my people.",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 70.931,
      "end": 74.6,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the Lord hath commanded me to make these plates",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 74.78,
      "end": 76.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for a wise purpose in him,",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 76.771,
      "end": 78.304,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which purpose I know not.",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 78.984,
      "end": 82.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the Lord knoweth all things from the beginning;",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 82.508,
      "end": 85.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, he prepareth a way",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 85.335,
      "end": 88.911,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to accomplish all his works among the children of men;",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 89.091,
      "end": 93.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, he hath all power unto the fulfilling of all his words.",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 93.636,
      "end": 95.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus it is.",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 95.256,
      "end": 96.092,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    }
  ]
}